                   (Neg.neg\n                            (HSub.hSub\n                              (nf.eval (CFDLean.Scalar.FiniteVolume.leftState g φ u i)\n                                (CFDLean.Scalar.FiniteVolume.rightState g φ u i))\n                              (nf.eval (CFDLean.Scalar.FiniteVolume.leftState g φ u i)\n                                (CFDLean.Scalar.FiniteVolume.rightState g φ u (g.prev i))))))\n                        (HMul.hMul (HMul.hMul (HAdd.hAdd (OfNat.ofNat 1) (HDiv.hDiv θ (OfNat.ofNat 2))) KR)\n                          (abs (HSub.hSub (u (DFunLike.coe g.next i)) (u i)))))","root":true,"type":"∀ {I : Type u_1} (g : CFDLean.Periodic.Grid I) (nf : CFDLean.Scalar.NumericalFlux) (φ : ℝ → ℝ → ℝ) (θ : ℝ),\n  CFDLean.Scalar.FiniteVolume.SlopeBounded θ φ →\n    θ ≤ 2 →\n      CFDLean.Scalar.MonotoneFlux nf →\n        ∀ (m M KL KR : ℝ),\n          CFDLean.Scalar.LipschitzOnBounds nf m M KL KR →\n            0 ≤ KR →\n              ∀ u ∈ CFDLean.Scalar.FiniteVolume.boundedStates m M,\n                ∀ (i : I),\n                  0 ≤\n                      -(nf.eval (CFDLean.Scalar.FiniteVolume.leftState g φ u i)\n                              (CFDLean.Scalar.FiniteVolume.rightState g φ u i) -\n                            nf.eval (CFDLean.Scalar.FiniteVolume.leftState g φ u i)\n                              (CFDLean.Scalar.FiniteVolume.rightState g φ u (g.prev i))) *\n                        (u (g.next i) - u i) ∧\n                    |(-(nf.eval (CFDLean.Scalar.FiniteVolume.leftState g φ u i)\n                              (CFDLean.Scalar.FiniteVolume.rightState g φ u i) -\n                            nf.eval (CFDLean.Scalar.FiniteVolume.leftState g φ u i)\n                              (CFDLean.Scalar.FiniteVolume.rightState g φ u (g.prev i))))| ≤\n                      (1 + θ / 2) * KR * |u (g.next i) - u i|","unsafe":false}
